<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>LARGE LANGUAGE MODEL</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 14 }}>LLM：参数量越大能力越强，但 2026 有新变量</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 22 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '28px 28px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 18 }}>旧规律：参数越大越强</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 20, marginBottom: 18 }}>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>1750亿</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', marginTop: 6 }}>GPT-3 · 2020</Text>
          </Box>
          <FAIcon name='arrow-right' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26, marginBottom: 10 }} />
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>1.8万亿</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', marginTop: 6 }}>GPT-4 · 2023</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          三年前，堆参数是主旋律——参数越多，模型越聪明，成本也越高。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '28px 28px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 18 }}>2026 新变量：MoE 反超</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 20, marginBottom: 18 }}>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 68, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>284B</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', marginTop: 6 }}>总参 / 13B 激活 · MoE</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          DeepSeek V4-Flash 用 MoE「只激活少量参数」，<span style={{ color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>小参数反超大参数</span>——比的是架构与效率，不是蛮力。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, background: '#DCE7F5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
        结论：2026 选模型不再看「谁最大」，而是看「谁更聪明、更省」
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 1 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>02 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
